TARSVideo Android v0.3 - official VLC Android player UI

WHAT CHANGES
- Replaces the handmade InternalVlcPlayerActivity with the official VLC Android VideoPlayerActivity.
- Pins VLC Android stable 3.7.1 source.
- Uses VLC's own player interface and VLC's own OpenSubtitles flow.
- Keeps Jellyfin responsible for catalog/login/history and sends the Direct Play URL to VLC.
- Keeps the standard VLC result extras so Jellyfin can receive position/duration.
- Removes MultiServer capability from the embedded Jellyfin web shell.
- Keeps the server fixed at https://video.douglas.seg.br.
- Hides the native change-server fallback.
- Masks the Jellyfin web loading logo with the TARSVideo logo.
- Uses an adaptive/padded TARSVideo launcher icon.

FILES TO REPLACE
