  You may leave it in the repository for now; it will not be compiled.

EXPECTED FIRST BUILD
This is a larger integration than v0.2 because the complete VLC Android player
library and its resources are compiled together with Jellyfin. The first CI run
may expose Gradle/resource/manifest compatibility issues. Those should be fixed
from the GitHub Actions log without returning to the handmade player.
